    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45366" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sternūmentum</span></b> , i, n.
		sternuo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a sneezing</i> (class.; but cf. sternutamentum).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Div.
				2, 40, 84</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 2, 7, 5, § 24</span></i>; <i><span class="en">21, 22, 93, §
